# Pinned capsule and library provenance for the pophys v2 pipeline.
#
# *_IMAGE_CO values are the Code Ocean images of the selected v2 pipeline; they contain that
# pipeline's library commits, not necessarily *_LIBRARY_COMMIT. *_LIBRARY_COMMIT is the library
# baked into the development GHCR images (pipeline/development_images.env).
# Wrapper and CO image baseline: aind-pophys-pipeline@d16dad4ad62b18e412a3104e53a42490add0d465.
# Evidence, resolved run parameters, and library selection: pipeline/baseline.json.

